# Scenario 'browser_redirect': the browser meets HTTP redirects. `net http_redirect=K` (harness option, mgba_trace.c) answers the next mapped page request with
# 302/301 and a Location that is absolute (K=1, 4), host-relative "/01/CGB-B9AJ/index.html" (2, 5) or path-relative "index.html" (3, 6), 303 (7) or 307 (8);
# `net http_redirect_count=1` limits it to one answer, so the ROM's retry (54:Http_Poll: error $32 with H=3, L=1/2 -> Url_ResolveLocation, at most three retries) fetches
# the target normally. Round 1 only used the absolute form (and it looked as if a 302 was never followed: it is, see the screenshots: the round-2 site's index page comes
# back for every 301/302 form). 303 ends in the error 32-303, 307 is followed like 302. The last visit redirects without limit: after the third retry the
# ROM gives up. Site: traces/web/r2 (web=r2). Starts from the state left by 'browser_bookmarks'. Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # title -> top menu (the first A is swallowed by the logo)
waitstable 60 max 600
tap RIGHT
wait 40
tap A                        # ホームページ
waitstable 60 max 900
shot pagelist_tutorial_1
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
tap A
waitstable 30 max 400
shot prompt
tap A                        # ホームページ
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A                        # はい
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A                        # password screen
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
wait 1200
shot index
shot r2_index
net http_redirect=1
net http_redirect_count=1
tap DOWN x3
wait 80
wait 20
tap A
wait 380
shot redir1
tap B
wait 160
net http_redirect=0
net http_redirect=2
net http_redirect_count=1
tap DOWN x3
wait 80
wait 20
tap A
wait 380
shot redir2
tap B
wait 160
net http_redirect=0
net http_redirect=3
net http_redirect_count=1
tap DOWN x3
wait 80
wait 20
tap A
wait 380
shot redir3
tap B
wait 160
net http_redirect=0
net http_redirect=4
net http_redirect_count=1
tap DOWN x3
wait 80
wait 20
tap A
wait 380
shot redir4
tap B
wait 160
net http_redirect=0
net http_redirect=5
net http_redirect_count=1
tap DOWN x3
wait 80
wait 20
tap A
wait 380
shot redir5
tap B
wait 160
net http_redirect=0
net http_redirect=6
net http_redirect_count=1
tap DOWN x3
wait 80
wait 20
tap A
wait 380
shot redir6
tap B
wait 160
net http_redirect=0
net http_redirect=7
net http_redirect_count=1
tap DOWN x3
wait 80
wait 20
tap A
wait 380
shot redir7
tap B
wait 160
net http_redirect=0
net http_redirect=8
net http_redirect_count=1
tap DOWN x3
wait 80
wait 20
tap A
wait 380
shot redir8
tap B
wait 160
net http_redirect=0
net http_redirect=1
net http_redirect_count=-1
tap DOWN x3
wait 80
wait 20
tap A
wait 380
shot redir_loop
tap B
wait 160
net http_redirect=0
shot end
